From e6e5570ad5530254e2bb7d03ff1f1adeee2b84d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:12:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(session): remembered detection follows git's rerere
 switch; placement on CRLF and edited gaps

rerere must be enabled as rerere.c decides; an unreadable MERGE_RR
keeps files for review; lines match without CR; overlapping blocks
join; one placement walk shared with the disk view.

Refs #1392-#1406
